OPEN COMMUNITY PATCH - RESTART REQUIRED

OpenShim was installed or updated successfully and is queued for verified replacement when Battlezone exits.

Completely exit Battlezone now. Returning only to the main menu is not enough because winmm.dll is still loaded by the running game process. After Battlezone closes, relaunch it normally.

After relaunch, play through SINGLE PLAYER > CUSTOM CAMPAIGN > Campaign Reimagined. You may also run ! SETUP / REPAIR - Open Community Patch again from Instant Action to verify the installed files.
